<div class="cover">
  <div class="kicker">CAMXORA</div>
  <h1>Apex Migration Plan</h1>
  <div class="subtitle">Moving the music platform to camxora.com while keeping music.camxora.com untouched</div>

  <table class="meta">
    <tr><td>Document</td><td>CAMXORA_APEX_MIGRATION_PLAN.doc</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Version</td><td>1.0 - Draft for approval</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Date</td><td>23 October 2026</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Owner</td><td>Product / Engineering</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Audience</td><td>Founder, frontend, backend, design, QA, operations</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Source of truth</td><td>New Camxora templates + current repo audit</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Status</td><td class="status">Awaiting decision on app base and runtime API</td></tr>
  </table>

  <div class="callout">
    <strong>One-line summary:</strong> Build a new apex application from the new templates, run it on
    <span class="mono">sandbox.camxora.com</span> first, keep <span class="mono">music.camxora.com</span>
    and <span class="mono">musicapi.camxora.com</span> untouched, and only then switch
    <span class="mono">camxora.com</span> to the new service with a one-step rollback.
  </div>
</div>

