</table>

<div class="callout">
  <strong>Key finding:</strong> <span class="mono">sandbox.camxora.com</span> already resolves and has TLS.
  We do not need new DNS for the first stage. We need a new service on <span class="mono">3103</span>
  and an nginx upstream change for the sandbox vhost.
</div>

<div class="warning">
  <strong>Current worktree is not clean.</strong> Branch <span class="mono">feat/web-music-free-monthly</span>
  has modified Python files and untracked docs/promo. Do not start the apex work there. Create a clean
  worktree from <span class="mono">main</span> for this migration.
</div>

<h2>4. Target architecture</h2>

<h3>4.1 Application layers</h3>
<table>
  <tr><th>Layer</th><th>Target</th></tr>
  <tr><td>New apex app</td><td><span class="mono">camxora.com/</span> - Next.js 16, React 19, new Camxora templates.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Service</td><td><span class="mono">camxora-web-apex.service</span> on port <span class="mono">3103</span>.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Browser API</td><td>Same-origin <span class="mono">/api/v3/*</span> rewrite to <span class="mono">platform_api</span>.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Auth</td><td>Existing platform accounts; first-party apex session; no change to old music cookies.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Player</td><td>New player UI; reuse <span class="mono">music_web</span> player engines and streaming logic underneath.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Content</td><td>New templates; legal/blog/download content migrated from <span class="mono">website/</span>.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Provider</td><td><span class="mono">musicapi</span> remains server-side/provider only; no browser calls.</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>4.2 Reuse strategy</h3>
<table>
  <tr><th>Reuse</th><th>Do not reuse</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Auth provider and session handling.</td><td>Old page JSX and old visual shell.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Player engines, streaming helpers, media session, playback fallbacks.</td><td>Old player markup and old CSS.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Library, likes, playlists, invites, credits, checkout clients.</td><td>Old card/table styles and old navigation.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Pricing, plans, release notes, legal content, blog content.</td><td>Old marketing layout.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>API contracts and database.</td><td>Hardcoded prototype prices, static pack data, external Unsplash images.</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>4.3 Host strategy</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Local:</strong> new app on <span class="mono">localhost:3103</span>; local platform API; seeded data; no live payments.</li>
  <li><strong>Sandbox:</strong> <span class="mono">sandbox.camxora.com</span> to new service on <span class="mono">3103</span>; old site remains on <span class="mono">3100</span>; <span class="mono">music.sandbox</span> remains old music.</li>
  <li><strong>Production:</strong> <span class="mono">camxora.com</span> and <span class="mono">www</span> switch to <span class="mono">3103</span>; <span class="mono">music.camxora.com</span> remains on <span class="mono">3102</span>.</li>
</ul>

<h2>5. Non-negotiable guardrails</h2>
<ul>
  <li>No DNS, nginx, service, or code changes to <span class="mono">music.camxora.com</span>.</li>
  <li>No changes to <span class="mono">musicapi.camxora.com</span> or its admin.</li>
  <li>No production deploy until sandbox signoff.</li>
  <li>No live payment keys on sandbox.</li>
  <li>No hardcoded credit prices; use the pricing table/API.</li>
  <li>Dark mode only; no light mode.</li>
  <li>Original <span class="mono">camxora-logo.svg</span> only.</li>
  <li>Inter + Niradei, self-hosted; no Google Fonts CDN in production.</li>
  <li>Font Awesome 7.3.1 local package; no external icon CDN.</li>
  <li>Primary buttons: <span class="mono">#8B00FF</span>, flat, 10px radius, white text.</li>
  <li>Header Sign in / Sign up: 96 x 36.</li>
  <li>Khmer text rendered with Niradei and tested at 390px and 1440px.</li>
  <li>Images blend into sections at every width; no hard-cut edges.</li>
  <li>Every new visible surface uses the new templates.</li>
  <li>One task per branch; one agent per worktree; path-scoped commits.</li>
</ul>

<div class="page-break"></div>

<h2>6. Deliverables and deliverable actions</h2>

<table>
  <tr><th>ID</th><th>Deliverable</th><th>Deliverable action</th><th>Acceptance criteria</th></tr>
  <tr>
    <td>D0</td><td>Approved foundation</td>
    <td>Approve the architecture, freeze the scope, create a clean worktree, and produce the route/component inventory.</td>
    <td>Decision log signed; route map approved; clean branch <span class="mono">feat/camxora-apex</span>; no production changes.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>D1</td><td>Sandbox shell</td>
    <td>Stand up the new app on <span class="mono">sandbox.camxora.com</span> with the new shell, tokens, player, and login.</td>
    <td>New home and player load over HTTPS; auth works; old <span class="mono">music.sandbox</span> still works; sandbox is noindex.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>D2</td><td>Listen-first public beta</td>
    <td>Ship Home, Discover, Charts, Search, Artist, Album, Playlist, 404, and SEO metadata.</td>
    <td>Browse, search, and play from sandbox; responsive at 390/768/1024/1440/2036; no console errors.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>D3</td><td>Core app beta</td>
    <td>Ship auth pages, Create, generation states, Library, playlists, likes, credits, pack modal, pricing, and checkout links.</td>
    <td>Create two versions, deduct credits correctly, save to library, play back, and open checkout in sandbox/test mode.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>D4</td><td>Creator surfaces</td>
    <td>Ship Community, artist pages, artist dashboard, Publish, and Artist Program.</td>
    <td>Artist profile, dashboard KPIs, publish flow, and program application work with sandbox data.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>D5</td><td>Products and content</td>
    <td>Ship Studio/download, Developers, About, Blog, Changelog, Contact, Legal, and footer content.</td>
    <td>All public routes exist; download uses release API; legal content reviewed; no dead links.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>D6</td><td>Launch-ready build</td>
    <td>Complete accessibility, performance, SEO, security, analytics, browser/device, and load testing.</td>
    <td>Launch gates pass; blockers closed; rollback tested; signoff recorded.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>D7</td><td>Production apex</td>
    <td>Deploy the new service to production, switch <span class="mono">camxora.com</span> and <span class="mono">www</span>, run smoke tests, and monitor.</td>
    <td>Apex live on <span class="mono">3103</span>; old music untouched; rollback available; 24-hour watch active.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td>D8</td><td>Stabilized migration</td>
    <td>Monitor, hotfix, measure, and decide whether to redirect or keep <span class="mono">music.camxora.com</span>.</td>
    <td>No P0 incidents; analytics baseline; redirect/retention decision recorded after the agreed window.</td>
  </tr>
</table>

<h2>7. Phases, tasks, and estimates</h2>

<p class="small">
  Estimates are working days for one full-time frontend engineer with part-time design, QA, and ops.
  Parallel work is possible after D1. Status is "Not started" unless noted.
</p>

<h3>Phase 0 - Foundation (2-3 days)</h3>
<table>
  <tr><th>ID</th><th>Task</th><th>Output / action</th><th>Est.</th><th>Depends on</th><th>Owner</th><th>Status</th></tr>
  <tr><td>P0-01</td><td>Create clean worktree</td><td>New branch <span class="mono">feat/camxora-apex</span> from clean <span class="mono">main</span>; do not use the dirty current branch.</td><td>0.5d</td><td>-</td><td>FE</td><td>Not started</td></tr>
  <tr><td>P0-02</td><td>Architecture decision record</td><td>App base, runtime API, auth, portal role, and old-music policy.</td><td>0.5d</td><td>P0-01</td><td>Product + FE</td><td>Not started</td></tr>
  <tr><td>P0-03</td><td>Prototype inventory</td><td>List all 35 prototype pages and shared components; map to Next routes.</td><td>0.5d</td><td>P0-01</td><td>FE + Design</td><td>Not started</td></tr>
  <tr><td>P0-04</td><td>Reuse audit</td><td>Identify <span class="mono">music_web</span> providers, player engines, API clients, and checkout modules.</td><td>0.5d</td><td>P0-01</td><td>FE</td><td>Not started</td></tr>
  <tr><td>P0-05</td><td>Content audit</td><td>Map <span class="mono">website/</span> legal, blog, changelog, download, and marketing pages.</td><td>0.5d</td><td>P0-01</td><td>Product + FE</td><td>Not started</td></tr>
  <tr><td>P0-06</td><td>Environment matrix</td><td>Local/sandbox/production URLs, env vars, OAuth, Turnstile, CORS, and noindex.</td><td>0.5d</td><td>P0-02</td><td>FE + Ops</td><td>Not started</td></tr>
  <tr><td>P0-07</td><td>Baseline and backup</td><td>Capture current apex screens/SEO; back up nginx/env/config; record rollback.</td><td>0.5d</td><td>P0-01</td><td>Ops</td><td>Not started</td></tr>
  <tr><td>P0-08</td><td>Risk and decision log</td><td>Create the live risk register and open-questions list in the repo.</td><td>0.5d</td><td>P0-02</td><td>Product</td><td>Not started</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>Phase 1 - Sandbox foundation (4-5 days)</h3>
<table>
  <tr><th>ID</th><th>Task</th><th>Output / action</th><th>Est.</th><th>Depends on</th><th>Owner</th><th>Status</th></tr>
  <tr><td>P1-01</td><td>Scaffold <span class="mono">camxora.com</span></td><td>Next.js app, TypeScript, lint, typecheck, build, health route.</td><td>0.5d</td><td>P0-02</td><td>FE</td><td>Not started</td></tr>
  <tr><td>P1-02</td><td>Port design tokens</td><td><span class="mono">--bg</span>, <span class="mono">--panel</span>, <span class="mono">--brand</span>, <span class="mono">--play</span>, <span class="mono">--focus</span>, type scale, spacing, radii.</td><td>0.5d</td><td>P1-01</td><td>FE + Design</td><td>Not started</td></tr>
  <tr><td>P1-03</td><td>Assets</td><td>Original logo, Inter, Niradei, Font Awesome 7.3.1, license notes.</td><td>0.5d</td><td>P1-01</td><td>FE</td><td>Not started</td></tr>
  <tr><td>P1-04</td><td>Shell</td><td>Sidebar, topbar, mobile header, footer, page container, auth states.</td><td>1d</td><td>P1-02</td><td>FE</td><td>Not started</td></tr>
  <tr><td>P1-05</td><td>Player</td><td>New player UI, queue, seek, like, mute, keyboard, mobile mini-player.</td><td>1.5d</td><td>P1-04</td><td>FE</td><td>Not started</td></tr>
  <tr><td>P1-06</td><td>API and auth wiring</td><td>Same-origin <span class="mono">/api/v3</span> proxy, session handling, login/logout, protected-route guard.</td><td>1d</td><td>P1-04</td><td>FE + BE</td><td>Not started</td></tr>
