<h2>9. Environment and sandbox plan</h2>

<h3>9.1 Environment matrix</h3>
<table>
  <tr><th>Setting</th><th>Local</th><th>Sandbox</th><th>Production</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Site URL</td><td class="mono">http://localhost:3103</td><td class="mono">https://sandbox.camxora.com</td><td class="mono">https://camxora.com</td></tr>
  <tr><td>API</td><td class="mono">local platform_api</td><td class="mono">https://api.sandbox.camxora.com</td><td class="mono">https://api.camxora.com</td></tr>
  <tr><td>User portal</td><td class="mono">http://localhost:3001</td><td class="mono">https://app.sandbox.camxora.com</td><td class="mono">https://app.camxora.com</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Old music</td><td class="mono">http://localhost:3002</td><td class="mono">https://music.sandbox.camxora.com</td><td class="mono">https://music.camxora.com</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Env flag</td><td class="mono">development</td><td class="mono">sandbox</td><td class="mono">production</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Turnstile</td><td>dev key</td><td>sandbox hostname</td><td>production hostname</td></tr>
  <tr><td>OAuth callback</td><td class="mono">/auth/callback</td><td class="mono">sandbox.camxora.com/auth/callback</td><td class="mono">camxora.com/auth/callback</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Indexing</td><td>noindex</td><td>noindex</td><td>index</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Payments</td><td>mock/test</td><td>sandbox/test</td><td>live only at cutover</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>9.2 Sandbox setup actions</h3>
<ol>
  <li>Create <span class="mono">camxora.com/</span> and build it on port <span class="mono">3103</span>.</li>
  <li>Add <span class="mono">camxora-web-apex.service</span> with environment from the sandbox matrix.</li>
  <li>Repoint the <span class="mono">sandbox.camxora.com</span> nginx block from <span class="mono">3100</span> to <span class="mono">3103</span>.</li>
  <li>Keep the old <span class="mono">3100</span> service running for rollback.</li>
  <li>Keep <span class="mono">music.sandbox.camxora.com</span> on <span class="mono">3102</span>.</li>
  <li>Add <span class="mono">X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow</span> and sandbox robots rules.</li>
  <li>Add Turnstile hostname and OAuth callback for sandbox.</li>
  <li>Add CORS origin only if direct API calls remain; prefer same-origin proxy.</li>
  <li>Set analytics to a sandbox property or disable it.</li>
  <li>Run smoke tests and capture screenshots.</li>
</ol>

<h3>9.3 Sandbox acceptance</h3>
<ul>
  <li class="check">&#9744; <span class="mono">https://sandbox.camxora.com</span> returns 200 and serves the new shell.</li>
  <li class="check">&#9744; Login, signup, logout, and session refresh work.</li>
  <li class="check">&#9744; Home, Discover, Search, Artist, Playlist, Album load.</li>
  <li class="check">&#9744; Player plays, seeks, queues, likes, and mutes.</li>
  <li class="check">&#9744; Create two versions, credits deduct, library updates.</li>
  <li class="check">&#9744; Pricing and checkout are sandbox/test only.</li>
  <li class="check">&#9744; 390/768/1024/1440/2036 screenshots pass.</li>
  <li class="check">&#9744; No console errors; no broken links; no external image/font dependencies.</li>
  <li class="check">&#9744; <span class="mono">music.sandbox.camxora.com</span> still works.</li>
  <li class="check">&#9744; <span class="mono">music.camxora.com</span> was not touched.</li>
</ul>

<h2>10. Production cutover and rollback</h2>

<h3>10.1 Cutover sequence</h3>
<ol>
  <li>Freeze apex changes; confirm sandbox signoff and launch checklist.</li>
  <li>Back up current nginx config, environment files, and service state.</li>
  <li>Deploy <span class="mono">camxora.com</span> to production <span class="mono">3103</span>.</li>
  <li>Keep the old <span class="mono">3100</span> website service running.</li>
  <li>Switch <span class="mono">camxora.com</span> and <span class="mono">www</span> upstream to <span class="mono">3103</span>.</li>
  <li>Reload nginx and purge Cloudflare cache for HTML.</li>
  <li>Smoke: home, auth, discover, play, create, library, pricing, legal.</li>
  <li>Monitor errors, latency, auth, playback, and payments for 24 hours.</li>
</ol>

<h3>10.2 Rollback</h3>
<div class="danger">
  <strong>Rollback is an nginx upstream change.</strong> Point <span class="mono">camxora.com</span> and
  <span class="mono">www</span> back to <span class="mono">127.0.0.1:3100</span>, reload nginx, and purge
  cache. No database rollback is required. Keep the old service running until aftercare is complete.
</div>
<ul>
  <li>Do not roll back or modify <span class="mono">music.camxora.com</span>.</li>
  <li>Do not modify <span class="mono">musicapi</span> or its admin.</li>
  <li>If a backend change is involved, gate it with a feature flag and a separate rollback.</li>
  <li>Record the exact rollback command and owner before cutover.</li>
</ul>

<h2>11. QA and launch gates</h2>

<table>
  <tr><th>Area</th><th>Required checks</th><th>Gate</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Auth</td><td>Login, signup, Google, logout, reset, verify, expired session, protected route.</td><td>Pass</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Create</td><td>Prompt, lyrics, style, generate, progress, A/B versions, cancel/retry, credits.</td><td>Pass</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Player</td><td>Play, pause, seek, queue, like, mute, keyboard, mobile mini-player, no autoplay.</td><td>Pass</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Library</td><td>Tracks, likes, playlists, filters, empty states, bulk actions.</td><td>Pass</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Discovery</td><td>Home, Discover, charts, search, artist, album, playlist.</td><td>Pass</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Pricing</td><td>API prices, pack modal, checkout redirect, no hardcoded values.</td><td>Pass</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Mobile</td><td>390px, 768px, landscape, touch targets, fixed player and dock.</td><td>Pass</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Accessibility</td><td>Contrast, focus, keyboard, labels, reduced motion, focus not obscured.</td><td>Pass</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Performance</td><td>LCP/CLS/INP, image sizes, font loading, no layout shift.</td><td>Pass</td></tr>
  <tr><td>SEO</td><td>Metadata, canonical, sitemap, robots, structured data, 404, redirects.</td><td>Pass</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Security</td><td>CSP, cookies, CORS, rate limits, no secrets, auth guard.</td><td>Pass</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Compatibility</td><td>Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari/iOS, Android.</td><td>Pass</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Regression</td><td>Old <span class="mono">music.camxora.com</span> and <span class="mono">musicapi.camxora.com</span> still return 200.</td><td>Pass</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>12. Risks and mitigations</h2>
<table>
  <tr><th>Risk</th><th>Impact</th><th>Mitigation</th><th>Owner</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Player rewrite regressions</td><td>High</td><td>Reuse player engines and streaming logic; new UI only; test iOS/Safari early.</td><td>FE + QA</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Auth/cookie mismatch across hosts</td><td>High</td><td>Host-only apex session in v1; no old-app cookie changes; test login/logout.</td><td>FE + BE</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Two frontends drift</td><td>Medium</td><td>Freeze <span class="mono">music_web</span>; new app is additive; no shared deploy.</td><td>Ops</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Wrong API target</td><td>High</td><td>One API client; same-origin proxy; no browser calls to musicapi.</td><td>FE</td></tr>
  <tr><td>External images/fonts</td><td>Medium</td><td>Owned/B2 assets; local fonts; no Unsplash in production.</td><td>FE + Design</td></tr>
  <tr><td>SEO duplication</td><td>Medium</td><td>Sandbox noindex; old host untouched; redirects only after approval.</td><td>FE</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Payment test hits live</td><td>High</td><td>Test keys only; no live checkout on sandbox; review before cutover.</td><td>BE + Ops</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Production switch mistake</td><td>High</td><td>Nginx-only switch; old <span class="mono">3100</span> running; one-step rollback; backup.</td><td>Ops</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Scope creep across 35 pages</td><td>High</td><td>Phase gates; MVP route subset; hide unfinished nav entries.</td><td>Product</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Dirty current branch</td><td>Medium</td><td>New clean worktree from <span class="mono">main</span>; no mixed commits.</td><td>FE</td></tr>
</table>

<h2>13. Decisions, open questions, and next actions</h2>

<h3>13.1 Decisions required before coding</h3>
<table>
  <tr><th>ID</th><th>Decision</th><th>Recommendation</th><th>Owner</th></tr>
  <tr><td>D-001</td><td>App base</td><td>New <span class="mono">camxora.com/</span> from <span class="mono">music_web</span> + <span class="mono">website</span>.</td><td>Product + FE</td></tr>
  <tr><td>D-002</td><td>Runtime API</td><td><span class="mono">platform_api</span> <span class="mono">/api/v3</span>; musicapi remains provider.</td><td>Product + BE</td></tr>
  <tr><td>D-003</td><td>User portal role</td><td>Keep <span class="mono">app.camxora.com</span> for billing/API keys in v1.</td><td>Product</td></tr>
  <tr><td>D-004</td><td>Auth cookies</td><td>Host-only apex session; no old-app cookie changes.</td><td>FE + BE</td></tr>
  <tr><td>D-005</td><td>Old music redirect</td><td>Keep as alias for at least 30 days after cutover.</td><td>Product + Ops</td></tr>
  <tr><td>D-006</td><td>Launch scope</td><td>MVP or full 35-page scope.</td><td>Product</td></tr>
  <tr><td>D-007</td><td>Analytics</td><td>Separate sandbox property; production property at cutover.</td><td>Product + Ops</td></tr>
  <tr><td>D-008</td><td>Asset source</td><td>Owned/B2 images; no external Unsplash.</td><td>Design</td></tr>
</table>

<h3>13.2 Open questions</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Is the new app allowed to use <span class="mono">platform_api</span> as the browser API, or must it use <span class="mono">musicapi</span>?</li>
  <li>Does <span class="mono">app.camxora.com</span> remain the billing/API-key portal after apex launch, or should account pages move into the apex app?</li>
  <li>Which pages are required for the first public beta?</li>
  <li>Who owns final legal copy review?</li>
  <li>Which analytics and error-tracking providers are approved?</li>
  <li>When should <span class="mono">music.camxora.com</span> redirect to <span class="mono">camxora.com</span>, if ever?</li>
</ul>

<h3>13.3 Next actions</h3>
<ol>
  <li>Approve D-001 and D-002.</li>
  <li>Create a clean worktree from <span class="mono">main</span> named <span class="mono">feat/camxora-apex</span>.</li>
  <li>Copy the prototype into the repo as a design reference under <span class="mono">camxora.com/design-reference</span> (not served).</li>
  <li>Produce the route map and component inventory from this document.</li>
  <li>Stand up the sandbox service on <span class="mono">3103</span> and repoint only <span class="mono">sandbox.camxora.com</span>.</li>
  <li>Ship the new shell, player, Home, and Discover to sandbox.</li>
  <li>Stop at the sandbox checkpoint; do not touch production or <span class="mono">music.camxora.com</span>.</li>
</ol>

<div class="success">
  <strong>Definition of success for the first checkpoint:</strong> the new Camxora templates are live on
  <span class="mono">sandbox.camxora.com</span> with the new shell, player, Home, Discover, and login;
  <span class="mono">music.camxora.com</span>, <span class="mono">musicapi.camxora.com</span>, and
  <span class="mono">app.camxora.com</span> are untouched; the nginx rollback is tested.
</div>

